<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.Name}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Just following up on the limited time Non-Standard Auto lead discount we’ve launched exclusively for Farmers agents in California. This discount is only available for a short time, so if you’re interested in learning more, shoot me an email or give me call at {{{Sender.Phone}}} soon to make sure you lock in your discount and desired lead volume.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I’d be happy to provide you with a free consultation where we can discuss the new promo pricing and explore the ways EverQuote can help drive ROI-positive growth for your agency.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<br />
<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Sincerely,<br />
{{{Sender.Name}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</body>
